  <informations>Unofficial QElectroTech conversion of original MDT manufacturer CAD drawing MDT_CAD_VC-EASY03.dxf. Manufacturer CAD geometry and logos retained. Original rights remain with MDT technologies GmbH. Colored front assembly thumbnail with reconstructed green terminals and screw heads. Not a wiring symbol. CAD overall envelope: 39.3994 x 91 mm including latch. Scale 2 QET units/mm. Source: https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/user_upload/user_upload/download/MDT_CAD_mdt_catalog.zip</informations>
